# game/script.rpy:12262
translate chinese windsor_siege_tutorial_c9df094d:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}教学——围城与攻城。{vspace=5}北安普顿委派你统筹对温莎的围城与随后的攻城。"

# game/script.rpy:12264
translate chinese windsor_siege_tutorial_ca4ad8ac:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}这座城市防御坚固，仅凭少量兵力发动一次进攻就想拿下，几乎是不可能的任务。"

# game/script.rpy:12266
translate chinese windsor_siege_tutorial_0e6f1d3e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}伯爵提出的策略，是以连续不断的进攻来拖垮守军的力量。{vspace=5}进攻温莎，给敌人造成损伤后便撤退休整，待力量恢复，再度发起进攻。"

# game/script.rpy:12268
translate chinese windsor_siege_tutorial_2bf288fd:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}被友军围困的城市切断了补给，守军无法补充兵力和辎重，一切损失与所受创伤都将无法复原。"

# game/script.rpy:12270
translate chinese windsor_siege_tutorial_e8c9d611:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}攻打温莎有两种方式。"

# game/script.rpy:12272
translate chinese windsor_siege_tutorial_c56f8d99:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}其一，亲率队伍出击，以身犯险。"

# game/script.rpy:12274
translate chinese windsor_siege_tutorial_bddfb70e:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}其二，招募民兵投入战斗，自己与队伍则无须涉险。{vspace=5}若要招募民兵，可去找军士。"

# game/script.rpy:12276
translate chinese windsor_siege_tutorial_65c3efad:

    nvl clear
    "{cps=50}{color=#A9A9A9}切记：围城的时间是有限的。"

