    old "Tarot card: The Death"
    new "塔罗牌：死神"
    old "The infamous 13th trump. A Major Arcana that can be found in most{vspace=5}traditional Tarot decks. While it does not necessarily spell one's doom,{vspace=5}it does signify an appearance of the Grim Reaper somewhere rather close.{vspace=5}But how close is too close?{vspace=5}*Will let you survive a killing blow once per fight{vspace=5}*Recovers half of your maximum HP{vspace=5}*Removes all active bleedings and poisonings, stuns and blinds from feints"
    new "臭名昭著的第十三张大牌。大多数传统塔罗牌组中都有的主牌（大阿尔克那）。它未必意味着厄运临头，但的确预示着死神已在某处悄然逼近。可究竟多近才算太近呢？{vspace=5}*每场战斗可抵挡一次致命攻击{vspace=5}*恢复最大生命值的一半{vspace=5}*清除所有生效的流血、中毒，以及佯攻造成的眩晕与致盲"
    old "{font=GoudyInitialen.ttf}{color=#8B0000}{size=+70}T{/size}{/color}{/font}arot card: The Death"
    new "{font=chn_font.otf}{color=#8B0000}{size=+30}死{/size}{/color}{/font}亡塔罗牌"
    old "Tarot card: The Devil"
    new "塔罗牌：恶魔"
    old "The 15th trump. The dreaded. The one and only. The Great Enemy.{vspace=5}Undoubtedly the most unpleasant Tarot card that signifies everything{vspace=5}vile and dark.{vspace=5}*Each kill recovers you 10 health{vspace=5}*Each kill lowers virtue by 5"
    new "第十五张大牌。令人畏惧。独一无二。大敌当前。毫无疑问是塔罗牌中最令人不快的一张，象征着一切污秽与黑暗。{vspace=5}*每次击杀恢复10点生命值{vspace=5}*每次击杀降低5点美德"
    old "{font=GoudyInitialen.ttf}{color=#8B0000}{size=+70}T{/size}{/color}{/font}arot card: The Devil"
