    old "{size=-7}{color=#A9A9A9}Authentic НWR experience — brutal{vspace=5}and unforgiving.{vspace=15}*Death is permanent{vspace=5}*Fair fights{vspace=5}*No increased gold rewards{vspace=5}*No bonus time in between battles{vspace=5}*Crafting requires recipes{vspace=5}*Game saves automatically{vspace=5}*Each death levels up your Profile"
    new "{size=-7}{color=#A9A9A9}原汁原味的HWR体验——残酷{vspace=5}而无情。{vspace=15}*死亡不可逆{vspace=5}*公平的战斗{vspace=5}*金币奖励不会增加{vspace=5}*战斗间隙没有额外时间{vspace=5}*制作需要配方{vspace=5}*游戏自动保存{vspace=5}*每次死亡都会提升档案等级"
    old "{size=-7}{color=#A9A9A9}Less challenging mode that will not require{vspace=5}you to master the combat system and{vspace=5}will not punish for every mistake.{vspace=15}*Enemies are handicapped{vspace=5}*Stamina always recovers successfully{vspace=5}*Gold rewards are more generous{vspace=5}*More time in between battles{vspace=5}*Game can be saved at any time{vspace=5}*{color=#8B0000}WARNING{/color}: Profile does not level up"
    new "{size=-7}{color=#A9A9A9}挑战性较低的模式，无需{vspace=5}精通战斗系统，{vspace=5}也不会因每个失误而惩罚你。{vspace=15}*敌人受到削弱{vspace=5}*体力总能顺利恢复{vspace=5}*金币奖励更慷慨{vspace=5}*战斗间隙时间更长{vspace=5}*随时可以存档{vspace=5}*{color=#8B0000}警告{/color}：档案不会升级"
    old "{size=-7}{color=#A9A9A9}Unchallenging mode for story enjoyers who{vspace=5}are not interested in combat or survival{vspace=5}aspects.{vspace=15}*Enemies are severely weakened{vspace=5}*Combat is simplified{vspace=5}*Gold is plentiful{vspace=5}*Lots of time in between battles{vspace=5}*Game can be saved at any moment{vspace=5}*{color=#8B0000}WARNING{/color}: Profile does not level up"
    new "{size=-7}{color=#A9A9A9}毫无挑战的模式，适合对战斗与生存{vspace=5}不感兴趣的{vspace=5}剧情爱好者。{vspace=15}*敌人被大幅削弱{vspace=5}*战斗简化{vspace=5}*金币充足{vspace=5}*战斗间隙时间充裕{vspace=5}*随时可以存档{vspace=5}*{color=#8B0000}警告{/color}：档案不会升级"
    old "{size=-7}{color=#A9A9A9}A more difficult mode that will offer you{vspace=5}a real challenge.{vspace=15}*Fair fights{vspace=5}*Game can be saved in between battles{vspace=5}*No increased gold rewards{vspace=5}*Crafting requires recipes{vspace=5}*No bonus time in between battles{vspace=5}*{color=#8B0000}WARNING{/color}: Profile does not level up"
    new "{size=-7}{color=#A9A9A9}难度更高的模式，{vspace=5}将为你带来真正的挑战。{vspace=15}*公平的战斗{vspace=5}*战斗间隙可以存档{vspace=5}*金币奖励不会增加{vspace=5}*制作需要配方{vspace=5}*战斗间隙没有额外时间{vspace=5}*{color=#8B0000}警告{/color}：档案不会升级"
    old "{size=-7}{color=#A9A9A9}Additional difficulty modifier for those{vspace=5}looking for an even tougher challenge.{vspace=15}*Weapons can lose durability and break{vspace=5}*Combat is way more deadly{vspace=5}*Even less time between story events{vspace=5}*Enemies are tougher and there's more of them{vspace=5}*Some of the prices are higher"
